+// UpdateLastKnownDefaultRouteInterface records the interface that currently
+// carries the default route, as reported by the host network manager.
+//
+// tailscaled normally learns this from /proc/net/route or an AF_NETLINK route
+// dump. Inside an OpenHarmony application sandbox both are unavailable: the
+// /proc view is reduced to the process's own routes and carries no default
+// entry, and AF_NETLINK route dumps are denied. Without a default interface
